          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "team_0160_head_teacher_20",
      "hash64": "401AC0BBE39734CD",
      "text": "天星队的战术和基地\\n都很特别，还很有独创性！[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "team_0160_head_teacher_21",
      "hash64": "401ABFBBE397331A",
      "text": "所以，基地会成为特训设施，\\n天星队会成为ＳＴＣ工作人员，\\r\\n我会请大家继续展开活动。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "team_0160_head_teacher_22",
      "hash64": "401ABEBBE3973167",
      "text": "……我说完了，有什么问题吗？[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "team_0160_botan_07",
      "hash64": "1B118DCD8DCB51E3",
      "text": "呃，这好像很有趣。\\n有点win-win的感觉……[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "team_0160_fairy_02",
      "hash64": "DD5A983A638C2DB1",
      "text": "这话由我们来说会很怪，\\n但牡丹，和我们一起干吧！[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "team_0160_doku_02",
      "hash64": "1D9A2FE70425B6D7",
      "text": "正是……\\n也请牡丹大人一起……[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "team_0160_kakutou_02",
      "hash64": "515BA81EB832E816",
      "text": "上下学也一起走吧！\\n不管发生什么我们都会保护你的！[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "team_0160_aku_02",
      "hash64": "294530D7AEE33A9F",
      "text": "我们几个说过，\\n如果能让天星队和上学的事\\r\\n两不误的话就再好不过了。[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
